Package: openmediavault-sunburstfs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, openmediavault (>= 7.0)
Description: Sunburst disk-usage chart for each file system
 Adds a page under Storage that renders a sunburst chart (rings
 for directory depth, arc size for bytes used) for a selected
 file system.
